  "title": "First Northwest Bancorp Reports Second Quarter 2026 Financial Results",
  "summary": "PORT ANGELES, Wash., July 29, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) - First Northwest Bancorp (Nasdaq: FNWB) (\"First Northwest\" or the \"Company\"), the holding company for First Fed Bank (\"First Fed\" or the \"Bank\"), today reported its financial results for the second quarter and first six months of 2026. The Company reported net income of $308,000 for the second quarter of 2026, compared to net income of $6,000 for the first quarter of 2026 and $3.7 million for the second quarter of 2025. Basic and diluted incom",
